========================================================================
  Welcome to KryX Linux Live (x86_64)
========================================================================
  Guided TUI installer : setup-kryx   (Arch-like dialog wizard + GRUB)
  CLI installer        : setup        (offline ISO pool or online kpm)
  Wi-Fi (no Ethernet)  : iwctl        (iwd + linux-firmware preloaded)
  Package manager      : kpm          (ports built in: `ports -u`)
  Handbook (CLI)       : curl -s https://kryx.anrix.org/install.txt | less

  Quick start (offline laptop install):
    1. Run the interactive TUI installer (partitions, installs, GRUB):
         setup-kryx
    2. Or install manually after mounting /mnt (and /mnt/boot/efi):
         setup --offline --root /mnt
         setup-chroot /mnt
========================================================================
